{"id":"27476a93ed7d19d4","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-cohesive-exists.md","title":"Cohesive 集的非有效存在","display":"lem-cohesive-exists — Cohesive 集的非有效存在","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-cohesive-exists","aliases":["20-lem-cohesive-exists"],"display":"lem-cohesive-exists — Cohesive 集的非有效存在","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"本地集合论证明","depends_on":["[[20-df-cohesive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-cohesive-exists"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-cohesive-exists</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-cohesive-exists — Cohesive 集的非有效存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地集合论证明"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8c66d3576ff86914\" href=\"?note=8c66d3576ff86914\" title=\"20-df-cohesive\">20-df-cohesive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_0,W_1,\\dots\">\\(W_0,W_1,\\dots\\)</span> 是全部 c.e. 集合的列举。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c66d3576ff86914\" href=\"?note=8c66d3576ff86914\" title=\"20-df-cohesive\">20-df-cohesive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cohesive\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\ \\operatorname{Cohesive}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cohesive\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\ \\operatorname{Cohesive}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取无穷递减集合 R_0=ω，每步在 R_e∩W_e 与 R_e−W_e 中选一个无限者作 R_(e+1)；从 R_n 递增选 c_n。C={c_n} 的尾部位于每个 R_e 内。构造只证明 ZFC 中的存在，不声称可计算选出无限分支。</p>\n<p>来源：本地集合论证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cohesive","status":"resolved","id":"8c66d3576ff86914","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cohesive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cohesive","status":"resolved","id":"8c66d3576ff86914","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cohesive]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W_0,W_1,\\dots","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cohesive\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\ \\operatorname{Cohesive}(C).","display":true}],"bytes":1006,"backlinks":[{"id":"096387ba1b2d18f5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-automorphism]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]；see [[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]；see [[20-df-arith]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-471","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-cohesive-exists]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-471","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]"}],"outgoing":["8c66d3576ff86914"]}